WEBVTT

00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:32.236
cheap, solar electricity,
wind electricity,

00:00:32.278 --> 00:00:34.072
electric vehicles, batteries,

00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:38.284
regenerative agriculture,
green hydrogen is coming along,

00:00:38.326 --> 00:00:39.786
sustainable forestry.

00:00:39.827 --> 00:00:43.081
But unfortunately,

00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:46.918
the crisis is getting much worse,

00:00:46.918 --> 00:00:49.504
much faster than predicted.

00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:52.548
And it is getting worse at a rate faster

00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:55.718
than the rate at which
we're deploying these solutions.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.304
We have everything we need,

00:00:58.304 --> 00:01:00.765
save sufficient political will.